          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Standalone iOS shortcut: runs iOS Dictate Text, passes the transcript through the shared tag picker, and POSTs the same <html:code>blurb</html:code>+<html:code>tags</html:code> payload as <fr:link href="/sss-008N/" title="Capture Prose shortcut" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-008N/" display-uri="sss-008N" type="local">Capture Prose</fr:link>.</html:p>
            <html:p>Same generator as Prose but with the dictation arm of <html:code>build_prose</html:code>:</html:p>
            <html:pre><![CDATA[if use_dictation:
    input_action = dictate(uuid_=input_uuid)
    input_output = "Dictated Text"]]></html:pre>
            <html:p>The <html:code>dictate</html:code> action wraps <html:code>is.workflow.actions.dictatetext</html:code> with English locale and "After Pause" stop condition:</html:p>
            <html:pre><![CDATA[def dictate(uuid_=None):
    return action(
        "is.workflow.actions.dictatetext",
        {
            "WFDictateTextLanguage": {
                "Value": {"Identifier": "en-US"},
                "WFSerializationType": "WFQuantityFieldValue",
            },
            "WFDictateTextStopListening": "After Pause",
            "UUID": uuid_ or uid(),
        },
    )]]></html:pre>
